   "text": "\\[\\begin{aligned}&\\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}x+2y-3z=4\\\\3x-y+5z=2\\\\4x+y+(\\lambda^2-14)z=\\lambda+2\\end{array}\\right.\\\\[5pt]&\\text{Find |A| first; it decides the}\\\\[5pt]&\\text{unique$-$solution case.}\\end{aligned}\\]",
